content/v1/57df71fe9f7456ee883fd9b4/1474857871742-D0KBR537U86PYO005UD0/closet.jpg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57df71fe9f7456ee883fd9b4/1474857871742-D0KBR537U86PYO005UD0/closet.jpg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57df71fe9f7456ee883fd9b4/1474857871742-D0KBR537U86PYO005UD0/closet.jpg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57df71fe9f7456ee883fd9b4/1474857871742-D0KBR537U86PYO005UD0/closet.jpg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57df71fe9f7456ee883fd9b4/1474857871742-D0KBR537U86PYO005UD0/closet.jpg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-loader=\"sqs\">\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    </div>\n  \n\n\n\n</div></div></div><div class=\"col sqs-col-8 span-8\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-e574a5901658e2f4b2ae\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <h2>Closet Consultation (Approximately 4-5 Hours)</h2><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">My new clients usually like to start with a closet consultation. &nbsp;Great style begins with a well-organized closet. &nbsp;I like my closet to be so organized that picking out an outfit is like shopping in a department store. &nbsp;Everything is displayed beautifully and folded nicely. &nbsp;When you walk into your closet you want to be able to easily find that perfect outfit.</span><span style=\"font-size:16px\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">I\u2019ll start with organizing and editing your wardrobe while thinking about what works best for you, deciding together what stays and what goes, and what just needs to be tailored for a better fit. &nbsp;This will include rehanging everything by season, as well as clothing and fabric type, so everything is easy to locate. &nbsp;I will organize your accessories - belts, scarves, jewelry, ties (for guys), bags and shoes so they are easily visible and ready to be layered to any outfit.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">We will discuss and prioritize what pieces might be missing from your closet that would enhance your current wardrobe, while thinking about current trends that you might want to add. &nbsp;I will also explain what silhouettes and designs might work best for your body type.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Once your closet has been put together, I will show you pieces that would look great together and teach you how to accessorize them. &nbsp;While you are trying on these pieces we will take pictures of you in these new</span><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&nbsp;outfits, from earrings to shoes, creating a style portfolio that you can easily reference.</span></p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div></div></div></div><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-spacer spacer-block sized vsize-1\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/b15e1495-af17-47ac-9f8a-858b1b9f8e3e_1275/website.components.spacer.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/b15e1495-af17-47ac-9f8a-858b1b9f8e3e_1275/website.components.spacer.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.spacer\" data-website-component-id=\"c1779c08ceb7a0886503\" id=\"block-c1779c08ceb7a0886503\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-4 span-4\"><div class=\"sqs-block image-block sqs-block-image\" data-aspect-ratio=\"100\" data-block-type=\"5\" data-sqsp-block=\"image-classic\" id=\"block-9c1c72c7346022b7ba93\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n  \n  \n    <div\n        class=\"\n          image-block-outer-wrapper\n          layout-caption-below\n          design-layout-inline\n          \n          \n          \n        \"\n        data-test=\"image-block-inline-outer-wrapper\"\n        data-sqsp-image-classic-block-layout=\"inline\"\n    >\n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure\n            class=\"\n              sqs-block-image-figure\n              intrinsic\n            \"\n            style=\"max-width:2448px;\"\n        >\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          <div\n              \n              \n              class=\"image-block-wrapper\"\n              data-animation-role=\"image\"\n              \n  data-animation-override\n\n          >\n            <div data-sqsp-image-classic-block-image-container class=\"sqs-image-shape-container-element\n              \n          \n        \n              has-aspect-ratio\n            \" style=\"\n                position: relative;\n                \n                  padding-bottom:100%;\n                \n                overflow: hidden;-webkit-mask-image: -webkit-radial-gradient(white, black);\n              \"\n              >\n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img data-stretch=\"false\" data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57df71fe9f7456ee883fd9b4/1474849013141-5ZGQ3PICP5WTPLX74PQF/IMG_7035.JPG\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57df71fe9f7456ee883fd9b4/1474849013141-5ZGQ3PICP5WTPLX74PQF/IMG_7035.JPG\" data-image-dimensions=\"2448x2448\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"IMG_7035.JPG\" data-load=\"false\" elementtiming=\"system-image-block\" data-sqsp-image-classic-block-image src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57df71fe9f7456ee883fd9b4/1474849013141-5ZGQ3PICP5WTPLX74PQF/IMG_7035.JPG\" width=\"2448\" height=\"2448\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 33.33333333333333vw, 33.33333333333333vw\" style=\"display:block;object-fit: cover; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-position: 50% 50%\" onload=\"this.classList.add(&quot;loaded&quot;)\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57df71fe9f7456ee883fd9b4/1474849013141-5ZGQ3PICP5WTPLX74PQF/IMG_7035.JPG?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57df71fe9f7456ee883fd9b4/1474849013141-5ZGQ3PICP5WTPLX74PQF/IMG_7035.JPG?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57df71fe9f7456ee883fd9b4/1474849013141-5ZGQ3PICP5WTPLX74PQF/IMG_7035.JPG?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57df71fe9f7456ee883fd9b4/1474849013141-5ZGQ3PICP5WTPLX74PQF/IMG_7035.JPG?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57df71fe9f7456ee883fd9b4/1474849013141-5ZGQ3PICP5WTPLX74PQF/IMG_7035.JPG?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57df71fe9f7456ee883fd9b4/1474849013141-5ZGQ3PICP5WTPLX74PQF/IMG_7035.JPG?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57df71fe9f7456ee883fd9b4/1474849013141-5ZGQ3PICP5WTPLX74PQF/IMG_7035.JPG?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-loader=\"sqs\">\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    </div>\n  \n\n\n\n</div></div></div><div class=\"col sqs-col-8 span-8\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-284a2acc840458dc29d5\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <h2>Shopping (Approximately 3-4 Hours)</h2><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Let\u2019s go shopping! &nbsp;I will take you shopping to explore classic pieces as well as some trendy styles that will fill in your existing wardrobe and enhance your closet. &nbsp;I will pre-shop and pre-select the stores based on your style, needs and budget so our time can be fun and efficient.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">As we are shopping we will talk about what works best on your body and we will discuss how to put the new pieces together with your existing closet. &nbsp;If you haven\u2019t had a closet consult with me we will have a conversation before our shopping trip to discuss your style, needs and what you are looking for to complete your looks.</span></p><p><strong>Add on:</strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"> &nbsp;Once our shopping is complete I can come back to your closet, take digital photos of the new clothes and accessories, mixing them with your existing closet to create new looks. &nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div></div></div></div><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-spacer spacer-block sized vsize-1\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/b15e1495-af17-47ac-9f8a-858b1b9f8e3e_1275/website.components.spacer.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/b15e1495-af17-47ac-9f8a-858b1b9f8e3e_1275/website.components.spacer.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.spacer\" data-website-component-id=\"3b43d016869316890fc7\" id=\"block-3b43d016869316890fc7\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-4 span-4\"><div class=\"sqs-block image-block sqs-block-image\" data-aspect-ratio=\"100\" data-block-type=\"5\" data-sqsp-block=\"image-classic\" id=\"block-07a630dfee04006426cc\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n  \n  \n    <div\n        class=\"\n          image-block-outer-wrapper\n          layout-caption-below\n          design-layout-inline\n          \n          \n          \n        \"\n        data-test=\"image-block-inline-outer-wrapper\"\n        data-sqsp-image-classic-block-layout=\"inline\"\n    >\n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure\n            class=\"\n              sqs-block-image-figure\n              intrinsic\n            \"\n            style=\"max-width:2500px;\"\n        >\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          <div\n              \n              \n              class=\"image-block-wrapper\"\n              data-animation-role=\"image\"\n              \n  data-animation-override\n\n          >\n            <div data-sqsp-image-classic-block-image-container class=\"sqs-image-shape-container-element\n              \n          \n        \n              has-aspect-ratio\n            \" style=\"\n                position: relative;\n                \n                  padding-bottom:100%;\n                \n                overflow: hidden;-webkit-mask-image: -webkit-radial-gradient(white, black);\n              \"\n              >\n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img data-stretch=\"false\" data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57df71fe9f7456ee883fd9b4/1474852547636-EVMQBWG2T37POPFHU9EP/closet.jpg\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57df71fe9f7456ee883fd9b4/1474852547636-EVMQBWG2T37POPFHU9EP/closet.jpg\" data-image-dimensions=\"2500x1667\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"closet.jpg\" data-load=\"false\" elementtiming=\"system-image-block\" data-sqsp-image-classic-block-image src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57df71fe9f7456ee883fd9b4/1474852547636-EVMQBWG2T37POPFHU9EP/closet.jpg\" width=\"2500\" height=\"1667\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 33.33333333333333vw, 33.33333333333333vw\" style=\"display:block;object-fit: cover; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-position: 50% 50%\" onload=\"this.classList.add(&quot;loaded&quot;)\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57df71fe9f7456ee883fd9b4/1474852547636-EVMQBWG2T37POPFHU9EP/closet.jpg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57df71fe9f7456ee883fd9b4/1474852547636-EVMQBWG2T37POPFHU9EP/closet.jpg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57df71fe9f7456ee883fd9b4/1474852547636-EVMQBWG2T37POPFHU9EP/closet.jpg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57df71fe9f7456ee883fd9b4/1474852547636-EVMQBWG2T37POPFHU9EP/closet.jpg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57df71fe9f7456ee883fd9b4/1474852547636-EVMQBWG2T37POPFHU9EP/closet.jpg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57df71fe9f7456ee883fd9b4/1474852547636-EVMQBWG2T37POPFHU9EP/closet.jpg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57df71fe9f7456ee883fd9b4/1474852547636-EVMQBWG2T37POPFHU9EP/closet.jpg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-loader=\"sqs\">\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    </div>\n  \n\n\n\n</div></div></div><div class=\"col sqs-col-8 span-8\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-84a839381075dda3ad86\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <h2>Wardrobe Update (Approximately 3-4 Hours)</h2><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Oftentimes a quick update will give new life to everything in your closet. &nbsp;A simple interview will determine what your needs are and what might be missing. &nbsp;It might be as simple as getting some trendy pieces for that season or shopping for some basics to round out everything else in your closet.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Once I have a clear understanding of what needs to be added we can shop for those individual pieces.</span></p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div></div></div></div><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-spacer spacer-block sized vsize-1\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/b15e1495-af17-47ac-9f8a-858b1b9f8e3e_1275/website.components.spacer.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/b15e1495-af17-47ac-9f8a-858b1b9f8e3e_1275/website.components.spacer.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.spacer\" data-website-component-id=\"yui_3_17_2_7_1474298337444_37511\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_7_1474298337444_37511\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">&nbsp;</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block image-block sqs-block-image sqs-col-4 span-4 float float-left\" data-block-type=\"5\" data-sqsp-block=\"image-classic\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_3_1474299133186_24728\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n  \n  \n    <div\n        class=\"\n          image-block-outer-wrapper\n          layout-caption-below\n          design-layout-inline\n          \n          \n          \n        \"\n        data-test=\"image-block-inline-outer-wrapper\"\n        data-sqsp-image-classic-block-layout=\"inline\"\n    >\n\n     