></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">I will prepare for you a digital portfolio that you can refer to while on your trip reminding yourself of all the different options and ways to wear.</span></p><p>\u00A0</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-spacer spacer-block sized vsize-1\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/b15e1495-af17-47ac-9f8a-858b1b9f8e3e_1275/website.components.spacer.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/b15e1495-af17-47ac-9f8a-858b1b9f8e3e_1275/website.components.spacer.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.spacer\" data-website-component-id=\"yui_3_17_2_3_1474299561541_11723\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_3_1474299561541_11723\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">&nbsp;</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block image-block sqs-block-image sqs-col-4 span-4 float float-left\" data-block-type=\"5\" data-sqsp-block=\"image-classic\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_3_1474299561541_14179\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n  \n  \n    <div\n        class=\"\n          image-block-outer-wrapper\n          layout-caption-below\n          design-layout-inline\n          \n          \n          \n        \"\n        data-test=\"image-block-inline-outer-wrapper\"\n        data-sqsp-image-classic-block-layout=\"inline\"\n    >\n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure\n            class=\"\n              sqs-block-image-figure\n              intrinsic\n            \"\n            style=\"max-width:768px;\"\n        >\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          <div\n              \n              \n            