://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57df71fe9f7456ee883fd9b4/1474852657624-T2RXI42G3M0IOFT5ZXIT/IMG_7372.JPG?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57df71fe9f7456ee883fd9b4/1474852657624-T2RXI42G3M0IOFT5ZXIT/IMG_7372.JPG?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57df71fe9f7456ee883fd9b4/1474852657624-T2RXI42G3M0IOFT5ZXIT/IMG_7372.JPG?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57df71fe9f7456ee883fd9b4/1474852657624-T2RXI42G3M0IOFT5ZXIT/IMG_7372.JPG?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-loader=\"sqs\">\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    </div>\n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_3_1474299561541_12239\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <h2>Events (Approximately 2-4 Hours)</h2><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">We all want to look our best, but we especially want to shine when going to a special event, whether it be a wedding, cocktail party, anniversary celebration, bar or bat mitzvah, or birthday party.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">I will do research to see what stores will best suit your style and budget and have the best selection for the type of event you are attending. &nbsp;We will shop together to find the best outfit that is the most flattering for the occasion. &nbsp;We will also outfit you with accessories from earrings all the way down to a great pair of shoes. &nbsp;When you walk into your event, heads will turn and you will feel confident in looking your best.</span></p><p>\u00A0</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-spacer spacer-block sized vsize-1\" data-block-css=